DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The aassbbttmm driver supports the Asus ASB 100 temperature sensor, making its
     sensor readings available through a sysctl(8) interface.

     The driver reads seven voltage (A/D) inputs, three fan inputs, two on-
     chip temperature sensors and up to two satellite temperature sensors.

